<title>USA: KeyCorp to name Henry Meyer president 1997.</title>
<headline>KeyCorp to name Henry Meyer president 1997.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>KeyCorp said Thursday that Henry Meyer, the company's chief operating officer, is expected to be named president of the company at its annual meeting in May.</p>
<p>The company also said its current president and chief executive, Robert Gillespie, has been elected chairman of the board. Victor Riley, the previous chairman, has been named chairman emeritus, the company said.</p>
<p>KeyCorp said Meyer has been elected a director and made vice chairman.</p>
</text>
